---
{
  title: "valid_account"
}
---
### NAME

    valid_account() - Returns 1 if the account is valid, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int valid_account( string name );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the account is valid, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    name  (string)
          The name of the account.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the account is valid, otherwise 0.
